Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.57,0:00:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:38.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:50.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:01:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:06.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.97,0:01:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:41.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The boat and the cyborg floats are at this address.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:45.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, what do you plan to do\Nwith this handful of weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:49.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm pushing for refugee liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:51.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn, I feel for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:54.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, not that I care, as long as I get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:04.25,Sign,,0,1200,680,,{\fs32}{\b1\i1}Receipt of Goods\N1702 Automatic Rifle x 200\N18 Recoilless Anti-Tank Cannon x 22\NGrenade x 180\NGunship x 4\NJetskis x 8\NPortable Missile Launcher x 15\NCyborg Floats x 48{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:07.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:23.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You bastard! You sold us out, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:09.32,Sign - Copy,,500,0,500,,{\b1}Rhapsody \N \N The Melody \N of a \N Bygone Nation{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.11,0:03:14.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How is the ID check going on the high-spec male\Ncyborg who tried to kill the Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:17.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've been looking, focusing on military personnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but we haven't got any hits yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After that helicopter went\Nout of control a while back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:24.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the military seriously upgraded their security.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:29.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,About that high-spec cyborg...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:34.02,Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}Note: PKF = Peace Keeping Force{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:34.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the only existing record shows that deployed\NPKF troops were equipped with this build.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:41.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Strangely, not only has the PKF's member list\Ndisappeared, but also their operation records.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:45.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, it's a maintenance-free\NPKF-spec model.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:50.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Togusa, what about the organisation that was supposedly\Ninvolved in the nuclear power plant in Shinjuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:53.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I haven't found anything\Nconcrete about that, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:59.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A new public agency that emerged\Nafter the new cabinet was established,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:02.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,not to mention one with members who\Nare well-connected with the SDF...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:05.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Eleven out-of-control helicopters...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:11.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Individual Eleven,\Nwho began to appear as if to echo that incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:16.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The nuclear power plant facility that was\Nsecreted away underground in Shinjuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:19.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have a whole lot of problems to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:22.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I heard that the Chief was called\Nto the Prime Minister's office again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:26.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in regards to "something" that\Nwas dug up at that power plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, he was; is there something\Nyou don't like about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:30.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't you think this is all\Nscrewed up to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:36.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I remember correctly, Section 9 is an organisation\Nthat goes on the offensive against crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:39.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if we're going to be held\Ndown by the scruff of our necks,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:42.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we sure as hell can't take any preemptive actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:44.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I won't argue with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:47.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and I'm sure the Chief feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:48.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is our greatest enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:05:00.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The answer is... numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:03.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In particular, in the face of an enemy\Nwith strong numerical superiority,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,organisations such as Section 9\Nwill be powerless and suffer defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:12.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If this current situation is\Nin itself an attack on us...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:17.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is it not possible to think that something is\Nstarting to happen elsewhere, unbeknownst to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:27.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You are aware that a plutonium\Nfuel rod was recovered
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:30.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,during an operation to re-bury the underground\Nnuclear power plant in Shinjuku, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:34.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have heard of it, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:39.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A plan was formulated to secretly\Ntransport the fuel rod to safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:42.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it was leaked to terrorists\Nbefore it could be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:48.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"We intend to enact divine\Npunishment upon the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:50.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,which has committed an act of folly\Nunder the very feet of the refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:53.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who await liberation as new citizens."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:57.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"We believe that returning what\Nhas been dug up by refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:06:01.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in the land of the refugees, to the refugees themselves\Nis the only reasonable and proper course of action."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:03.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"The Individual Eleven."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That symbol's on there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:14.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After that declaration arrived,\Nthe Coast Guard interrupted a weapons deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:19.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but there is a possibility that a large\Namount of weaponry had already been sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The original plan was to\Ntransport the fuel rod by sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:32.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, a receipt left behind by the\Nterrorists led us to expect an attack at sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.23,0:06:35.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so there has been a change in plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:42.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, the new plan is to have Section\N9 transport the fuel rod by land?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:44.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:47.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Section 9 does not officially exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In other words, it is an ideal agency to employ\Nas a means of transporting a pre-war relic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:54.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that isn't supposed to exist in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And what is your opinion on this\Nmatter, Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:02.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I believe the decision is... appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:14.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prime Minister, if I may ask one question?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:15.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:21.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To what extent were you aware of\Nthe nuclear power plant in Shinjuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:25.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I first learned of its existence\Nwhen the plutonium was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:26.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:28.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:38.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The operation's details are\Nas previously reviewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:44.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will use ground transport to move the plutonium\Nfuel rod from the residential refugee sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:45.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:50.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As I thought, the excavation was a secret operation under\Ngovernment supervision. If so, then why did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:52.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:56.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since when did Section 9 become\Nthe Prime Minister's errand boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:58.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We haven't switched roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:07:59.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:02.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It just means that someone else\Nbeat us to the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't that right, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:10.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:14.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:20.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am quite relieved to hear that you\Nwill accompany me on my first drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:24.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are {\i1}you{\i} doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not to mention that you're saying you're "with" us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My sentiments exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:31.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To think that I got hauled out here to supervise\Nthe cleanup of such a worthless wartime relic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:34.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why me? It's infuriating, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:37.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hi there. Thanks for the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:44.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cabinet Intelligence Agency, Investigative\NCouncil for Possible Changes to Wartime Strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:45.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Representative Aide, Gouda Kazundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:47.34,Default,,1115,0,250,,{\fs52}{\i1}Gouda: What an awful job this is.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:47.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Representative Aide, Gouda Kazundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:47.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Representative Aide, Gouda Kazundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:50.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So that's who he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:16.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Commander, it appears that the recovery\Nteam has departed Niihama as scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:20.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see. I hope nothing goes wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:22.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hope so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:36.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Like monkeys in a zoo, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:37.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:41.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't say things that might provoke them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:44.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If they cross the fence,\Nthey'll either be shot to death or deported.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:47.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even they understand that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:06.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, does that mean the on-site SDF were not\Neven made aware of what they were protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:08.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:11.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There are many things in this world\Nthat one does not need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:15.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In order to manipulate information with\Nefficiency after the operation is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:18.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it is desirable to have a minimal\Nnumber of people know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.91,0:10:23.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If that's the case, why didn't the Cabinet Intelligence\NAgency conduct this entire operation in the first place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:24.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not to mention...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:27.00,Main Dialogue,,0,1300,150,,Togusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:32.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I believe this is the first time we've met...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:33.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have we met before somewhere...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:36.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:39.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, we'll arrive soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:41.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou, Pazu, Bomer;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:45.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,once you acquire the truck,\Nrendezvous with the team at 2200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:46.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:48.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Take Tachikoma as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:52.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I must ask that you not use the\Nsentient tanks in this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:53.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:56.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wish to avoid provoking the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.49,0:11:11.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Gouda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:16.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I understand that you are fully\Nin charge of this operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:18.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I will have you follow our orders on-site.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:20.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Otherwise, we cannot guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:25.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will have you drop in tandem with Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:27.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll be dropping first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:34.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now then, shall we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not very fond of things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:38.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, how nice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:43.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No time to waste; let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:44.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've been in a cold sweat ever\Nsince I heard this was plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:46.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:50.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll take over and transport this\Nout of the residential refugee sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:51.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:54.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, my subordinates\Nmay have been irradiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:57.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry, such concern is unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:59.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What would a bureaucrat know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:03.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You may despise bureaucrats all you\Nlike, but this is government policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:06.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Each section has a designated function.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:09.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you dislike that fact, take off your uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:14.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, I'm sure that it will not put you at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, I have a favour to ask of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:19.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll tell you over a closed-circuit link.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:20.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:24.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry. It's just a bureaucrat\Ndoing his job: cleaning up a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:41.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Commander, the transport vehicle has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:42.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.69,0:13:45.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,An XO and a Private from our\Nranks will accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:46.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is the concession.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:50.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Affirmative. We will depart as soon\Nas we finish reinforcing the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:15.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, we're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's somehow unnerving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:16.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can't rule out the possibility that the\NIndividual Eleven may have a hijacking planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:18.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it's not as though they have a\Nfirm partnership with the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:23.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be careful, but don't get paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:29.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm more worried about where the leak of\Nthe previous sea-route plans came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:30.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:34.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If it becomes known that plutonium is on this bus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:36.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they'll be very surprised, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:39.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cut the lame chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:43.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry. Unlike you people,\NI live by this "chitchat".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:50.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:54.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, have you heard of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:57.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In Nagasaki's residential refugee sector,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:16:00.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a girl about her age fired on a policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's the point in trying to make us nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:14.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems your team members have\Nundergone extensive training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:17.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your female commander is frightening, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not as much as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:22.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh? Why did you join Section 9 under her command?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:26.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could it be that you have feelings for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Surely not, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:31.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What a joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, how is the route recon going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:36.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll send you data from the satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:41.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The road becomes elevated ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:42.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.09,0:16:46.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Once you reach the old highway,\Nyou'll have exited the refugee sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:50.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Soon after that, we'll be done, when we hand over\Nthe package to the receiver from Yokosuka base.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:54.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The perimeter highway is more dangerous, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:59.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The majority of the buildings left in that area lie\Ncollapsed and abandoned; they block both sides of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:03.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the terrorists laid an ambush\Nthere, we won't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:05.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:08.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is Gouda thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.69,0:17:12.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, once you finish making a pass through\Nthe route, try digging into his background.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, I intend to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:30.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's now thirty years since the last World War.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:34.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That they've still done nothing with the Kantou region\Nis basically the end result of them trying to maintain
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:38.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,ambiguity regarding the refugee problem, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:42.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Perhaps the issue has reached critical mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:46.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:47.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:48.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:49.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can see it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:51.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't like it at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:07.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, can you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:09.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, could it be an accident that\Nresulted in an overturned vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:12.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not sure. I'm going to check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:16.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we are to prioritise safety,\Nthe obvious solution would be to take a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:24.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Considering our cargo,\Nwe must avoid combat at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:26.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why we're camouflaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:29.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll scout this out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.82,0:18:34.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the terrorists are waiting for us in\Nthere, we'll just have to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:35.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:36.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, who will go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:38.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:40.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou will assume command here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:42.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right; I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though I may not look\Nit, I get along with refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I also want one of the GSDF men to come\Nalong; your subordinates are too hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:04.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you from the western district?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:07.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.14,0:19:08.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'd like to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So would we.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:14.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry, but we don't have time to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:16.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll just be going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:17.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:21.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's enough room next to the\Ntruck for the bus to pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:25.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go slow, and if you see anything that looks\Nbad, leave us behind and punch through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:26.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:45.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Situation normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:47.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:56.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:19:58.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:19:59.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:02.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:09.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, that guy has a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:16.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Togusa, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:26.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:46.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:49.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were they just refugees?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.26,0:20:52.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We killed them needlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:30.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:33.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Information on the armed terrorist\Nattack appears to have been false.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:36.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fortunately, it was just wasted effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:45.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Aramaki, Section 9 did an\Nexcellent job again in this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.23,0:21:47.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am extremely grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:48.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you being sarcastic, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.93,0:21:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I mean what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.73,0:22:00.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.33,0:22:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:08.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bastard! Back there, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:12.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By now, the GSDF's 2nd Bridging Platoon\Nwill have withdrawn from camp and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:15.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,sent the plutonium out by sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So you used us as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:20.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just who the hell do you think we are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:24.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And who do {\i1}you{\i} think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:27.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A small, elite force of top agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:33.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you had been attacked by a horde of refugees\Nwho were armed with contraband weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:35.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you would've been powerless to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.64,0:22:40.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be thankful that you even got to play\Nthe decoy role in my production.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:42.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:11.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.06,0:23:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.73,0:23:20.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:24.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:35.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:37.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:37.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.75,0:23:39.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:41.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:42.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:43.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:44.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:45.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.81,0:23:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:51.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:53.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:54.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:23:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:00.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:01.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:04.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:07.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.83,0:24:09.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.23,0:24:10.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.43,0:24:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:12.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.93,0:24:13.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:15.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.75,0:24:16.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:20.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:20.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside\Nto make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:21.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
